## Import

Import is supported using `organization/entry_id`. The organization comes first because reading an entry requires listing its organization's allow list. A slug organization contains a slash of its own, so the last slash in the import ID separates the entry ID:

```shell
terraform import circleci_url_orb_allow_list_entry.example "gh/acme/ba98990a-5a00-4cad-b55e-b44117b92e0c"
```

```shell
terraform import circleci_url_orb_allow_list_entry.example "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/ba98990a-5a00-4cad-b55e-b44117b92e0c"
```
